INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R8_bairesdev_vp_sales:p0','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R8_bairesdev_vp_sales','summary[0]',NULL,'In technology services, the competitor is almost never the other vendor on the shortlist. It is the client’s own hiring plan. That comparison gets made on a single number — your rate against their fully-loaded salary — and it is a frame you lose even when you are right, because it prices the seat and ignores the vacancy. Reps who have not been taught to move that comparison spend the whole cycle defending a rate.','2026-09-03T06:26:47','2026-09-03T06:26:47',0.8,'5f4cc7962580a14f702ca2d398ed05f373c62b07','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R8_bairesdev_vp_sales:p1','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R8_bairesdev_vp_sales','summary[1]',NULL,'I spent five years inside an IT services and staffing firm learning that objection from the inside. At TEKsystems I opened net-new managed services logos at Wayfair and Disney’s ESPN and Entertainment Technology organization, produced more than half the revenue on the Vertex Pharmaceuticals account by breaking into two groups that had never bought from us, and won a proof-of-concept that converted into a multi-million-dollar managed services expansion. In my last two years there I led and coached a team of client-facing sales professionals against daily process reviews and 1:1 metric tracking while carrying my own book.','2026-09-03T06:26:47','2026-09-03T06:26:47',0.8,'b04c7f6c087d3e9edcdac2603c55f09cfc6ae315','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R8_bairesdev_vp_sales:p2','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R8_bairesdev_vp_sales','summary[2]',NULL,'What I have added since is the buy-side of that same conversation. As Chief Strategy Consultant to an early-stage AI company I sit opposite the CEO and board on build-versus-buy decisions — restructuring a proposed $950K-per-year, five-person engineering build into a lean model at roughly a quarter of the cost, and recommending a sub-$500K MVP path over a multi-million-dollar infrastructure build. I have run the math a services buyer runs before they ever take the call.','2026-09-03T06:26:47','2026-09-03T06:26:47',0.8,'f87de6e451b80261dc7631a0774786179fcfaa74','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
