INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R10_mri_simmons_audience:p0','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R10_mri_simmons_audience','summary[0]',NULL,'Selling into a holding company is rarely a selling problem. It is a routing problem. The person who understands what your data makes possible and the person who can commit budget to it usually sit in different departments, report through different P&Ls, and are never in the room together. Deals do not die in that gap so much as go quiet in it.','2026-08-26T20:34:27','2026-08-26T20:34:27',0.8,'16861f0ed6ff93ad07b1475a6acece08826c88c8','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R10_mri_simmons_audience:p1','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R10_mri_simmons_audience','summary[1]',NULL,'Eight years of enterprise selling has mostly been that routing work. At TEKsystems I produced more than half the revenue on a single pharmaceutical account by breaking into two groups that had never bought from us, and opened managed services relationships inside Wayfair and Disney’s ESPN and Entertainment Technology organization — in each case by finding the team whose problem the incumbent relationship did not touch. I sell advertising directly to brands today as Ad Sales Director in sports publishing.','2026-08-26T20:34:27','2026-08-26T20:34:27',0.8,'3577de16c5ffcb789c24d7f7a086dc4fa948c24f','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R10_mri_simmons_audience:p2','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R10_mri_simmons_audience','summary[2]',NULL,'The data side is where I spent the two years before that, leading TEKsystems’ Data Analytics & Insights practice in New York — running discovery with a utility’s Center of Excellence on data science, machine learning, and governance, and scoping solutions for buyers who needed the value of a data asset translated before they could fund it. As Chief Strategy Consultant to an early-stage AI company this year, I designed the segmentation and the sampling methodology behind a 150-account research study. Translating what a dataset makes possible into something a buyer can commit budget to is the throughline.','2026-08-26T20:34:27','2026-08-26T20:34:27',0.8,'2400ecd18fad1f29d7259348965fca5a58059801','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
