INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R11_magellan_measurement:p0','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R11_magellan_measurement','summary[0]',NULL,'Measurement rarely stalls on the technology. It stalls on accountability. Once exposure is tied to conversions, someone has to own a number that used to be an estimate — and that, not the tool, is what keeps a client who already has attribution from expanding their use of it. Finding that kind of unnamed structural gap is what I do, because it is almost always what sits behind a "no."','2026-08-26T06:20:34','2026-08-26T06:20:34',0.8,'e93de60b5ff2b8bd3edbdf0e002afa2432bdcde8','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R11_magellan_measurement:p1','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R11_magellan_measurement','summary[1]',NULL,'I come at it from both sides of the ad transaction. I sell advertising for a living — currently as Ad Sales Director in sports publishing, where I work advertisers through their budget mechanics (co-op dollars, MDF, 501(c)(3) tax-exempt spend) to understand not just whether a buyer has money, but who answers for how it performs. Before that, five years at TEKsystems — the last two leading its Data Analytics & Insights practice — where revenue came from expansion, not new logos: over half the revenue on a single pharmaceutical account plus two net-new groups opened inside it, and a proof-of-concept that converted into a multi-million-dollar managed services expansion.','2026-08-26T06:20:34','2026-08-26T06:20:34',0.8,'92b2c420597cb99d13642eeb8afa840988daea69','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R11_magellan_measurement:p2','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R11_magellan_measurement','summary[2]',NULL,'Most recently, as Chief Strategy Consultant to an early-stage AI company, I built the measurement framework the business is now run against — CAC, payback, churn, and time-to-first-value — and turned that analysis into the pitch deck, battlecards, and executive briefings the team sells with. Setting the metric and telling the story from it are the same job, and it is the job this role describes.','2026-08-26T06:20:34','2026-08-26T06:20:34',0.8,'964de58c469c1d0b0637fb2ecb35ecb9c0d938fe','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
