INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R14_smartly_agency_partnerships:p0','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R14_smartly_agency_partnerships','summary[0]',NULL,'The failure mode of a player-coach seat is predictable. The quota you carry personally gets your Tuesday; the pod’s number becomes something you inspect on Friday, after it is too late to change. The leaders who beat that do not split the two jobs — they run their own deals on the same standard they hold the team to, so coaching stops being a meeting and becomes the rep watching how the work is actually done.','2026-08-26T20:38:36','2026-08-26T20:38:36',0.8,'caa21c0a861f9a571fe27c29d7a5ec2689a47706','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R14_smartly_agency_partnerships:p1','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R14_smartly_agency_partnerships','summary[1]',NULL,'That is the shape my last two roles have taken. At TEKsystems I coached a team of client-facing reps against daily process reviews and 1:1 metric tracking while carrying my own book, winning a proof-of-concept RFP that converted into a multi-million-dollar managed services expansion. I carry an individual number again today as Ad Sales Director in sports publishing, and across eight years my growth has come from complex, multi-stakeholder deals inside large organizations — Vertex Pharmaceuticals, Wayfair, Universal Parks, Disney’s ESPN and Entertainment Technology group.','2026-08-26T20:38:36','2026-08-26T20:38:36',0.8,'89a8078494fd4369059930d635a3da9b55f61798','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R14_smartly_agency_partnerships:p2','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R14_smartly_agency_partnerships','summary[2]',NULL,'The other half of this job is building structure that does not exist yet, which is what I have spent this year doing as Chief Strategy Consultant to an early-stage AI company: the RACI and escalation thresholds that route work to a named owner, the weekly capacity forecast, and the one-page decision log that carries a single recommendation, owner, and date. Repeatability is not a personality trait on a team. It is an operating cadence somebody has to design.','2026-08-26T20:38:36','2026-08-26T20:38:36',0.8,'f090b166b3b0ebee98ca31c61d270df7fd856a77','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
