INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R16_admarketplace_adv_success:p0','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R16_admarketplace_adv_success','summary[0]',NULL,'The growth inside an advertiser book is almost never where the account plan says it is. It sits with a stakeholder nobody has met yet, behind a budget nobody has traced. Most of my career has been spent finding that — first for my own accounts, then teaching a team to find it without me in the room.','2026-08-26T06:27:00','2026-08-26T06:27:00',0.8,'c98a91e6a10e1cb8ad3b3d62573a37f510dc070b','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R16_admarketplace_adv_success:p1','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R16_admarketplace_adv_success','summary[1]',NULL,'Eight years in performance-driven sales, and the revenue has consistently come from expansion rather than new logos: more than half the revenue on a single enterprise account plus two net-new groups opened inside it, and a proof-of-concept converted into a multi-million-dollar managed services expansion. I sell advertising directly to brands today as Ad Sales Director in sports publishing, where my qualifying question is rarely about creative or rate — it is about where the money comes from. Co-op dollars, MDF, and 501(c)(3) tax-exempt budgets do not just fund a buy; they determine who is accountable for how it performs, which is the same thing as knowing who can approve more of it.','2026-08-26T06:27:00','2026-08-26T06:27:00',0.8,'5cf2b0c81599d3ff888917fd33af6a88bbceec5d','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
INSERT INTO "evidence" VALUES('ev:R16_admarketplace_adv_success:p2','HISTORICAL_RESUME','resume','R16_admarketplace_adv_success','summary[2]',NULL,'On the leadership side, I have coached client-facing teams through daily sales process reviews and 1:1 metric-tracking, and as a strategy consultant I build the operating infrastructure that makes coaching hold: RACI and escalation-threshold design, one-page decision logs carrying a single recommendation, owner, and date, and a weekly review cadence. I would rather set the standard once and let a team execute against it than inspect every deliverable that crosses my desk.','2026-08-26T06:27:00','2026-08-26T06:27:00',0.8,'d3ff730e4b046d1c88031f9746f12e7668c4154e','2026-09-28 01:58:06',NULL);
