test in first full year against a national field.", "Produced more than half the revenue on Vertex Pharmaceuticals, the firm''s largest regional growth account, and expanded into two new groups.", "Opened net-new managed services accounts at Wayfair and Disney''s ESPN and Entertainment Technology organization from cold.", "Partnered with Nike''s global supply chain team on in-season optimization, delivering an AI-powered document system."], "bullet_ids": [66, 67, 69, 70], "achievement_ids": ["tekr-750k", "tekr-vertex", "tekr-wayfair-disney", "tekr-nike"]}, {"key": "demanddrive", "title": "Sales Development Representative / Inside Sales Representative", "employer": "Amazon Business / demandDrive", "location": "Waltham, MA", "dates": "2018 \u2013 2020", "context": "E-commerce and retail technology", "bullets": ["Authored a territory-realignment and post-close operations model adopted company-wide, credited with 150% growth in the Amazon Key for Business launch.", "Delivered 200% of first-month quota (12 meetings vs. 6) on a net-new client engagement; named MVP of the Month."], "bullet_ids": [72, 74], "achievement_ids": ["dd-territory-proposal", "dd-200-quota"]}], "certifications": ["Claude 101 \u2014 Anthropic (August 2026)", "Claude Code 101 \u2014 Anthropic (2026)", "Claude for CoWork \u2014 Anthropic (In progress)", "Insurance Broker License \u2014 Accident, Health, Life, Variable Life & Variable Annuity \u2014 New York State Department of Financial Services (December 2025)", "Data Analytics & Insights: Data Insights \u2014 TEKsystems (December 2023)"], "education": [{"degree": "B.S., Finance & Marketing (Double Major)", "school": "University of Maine Business School", "year": "2018", "bullets": ["Senior Capstone \u2014 Northeast Intermodal Competitive & Market Analysis: market sizing, Porter''s Five Forces, competitor profiling, and a positioning recommendation."]}], "expertise": [{"label": "Go-To-Market & Revenue", "items": ["GTM strategy", "market segmentation",